Vendored, unmodified, from https://github.com/pq-crystals/kyber branch `standard` (the FIPS 203
ML-KEM reference), `ref/` directory, commit d5b791c. CC0 / Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE). Excluded:
nistkat/, test/, Makefile. Built here as ML-KEM-768 (KYBER_K=3, the params.h default).
Cross-verified against Go crypto/mlkem: tests/mlkem_interop/. Glue: runtime/parena_runtime.h
(PARENA_WITH_MLKEM). Note: randombytes.c duplicates mldsa/randombytes.c's `randombytes` symbol.
